0a2\tDoubled to 38\u00a2 (Jul 2019) + CPI indexing + local taxes\nCalifornia\t~33\u00a2\t~54\u201373\u00a2\t+21\u201340\u00a2\t+12\u00a2 (Nov 2017) + annual inflation indexing\nIndiana\t~23\u00a2\t~51\u201355\u00a2\t+28\u201332\u00a2\t+10\u00a2 (2017) + inflation indexing + 7% use tax on gas\nOhio\t28\u00a2\t38.5\u00a2\t+10.5\u00a2\tSingle increase (2019)\nMichigan\t~24\u00a2\t~47\u201352\u00a2\t+23\u201328\u00a2\t+7.3\u00a2 (2017) + annual inflation adjustments (2022+)\nWashington\t44.5\u00a2\t~53\u201356.5\u00a2\t+9\u201312\u00a2\t2% annual compounding since 2016 increase\nOregon\t~30\u00a2\t~40\u201346\u00a2\t+10\u201316\u00a2\t10\u00a2 phased in 2018\u20132024\nMissouri\t17\u00a2\t29.5\u00a2\t+12.5\u00a2\tProposition D (2018), phased 2021\u20132025\nSouth Carolina\t17\u00a2\t~29\u00a2\t+12\u00a2\t12\u00a2 phased over 6 years (2017\u20132022)\n\nNotable 2026 Adjustments", "author": "nufosmatic", "created": 1792655390122, "profile_picture": "PiN9pDmgR3ja", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "TurdBurglarGrimace", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "So, basically, these various Blue states have DOUBLED gas taxes since Trump was first elected, but Trump gets the blame for high gas taxes. Do I have that right?", "last_comment_created": 1792658536109, "content": "<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://search.brave.com/ask?q=How+have+state+gas+taxes+changed+since+2016%3F&amp;conversation=09b6424bf192f0669de589a3f64c28b050c1\" target=\"_blank\">https://search.brave.com/ask?q=How+have+state+gas+taxes+changed+since+2016%3F&amp;conversation=09b6424bf192f0669de589a3f64c28b050c1</a></p>\n<hr />\n<p>Largest Increases\nState\t2016 Rate\t2026 Rate\tChange\tDriver\nNew Jersey\t14.5\u00a2\t~42\u201349\u00a2\t+28\u201335\u00a2\t22.6\u00a2 jump (Nov 2016) + variable-rate formula\nIllinois\t19\u00a2\t~48\u201367\u00a2\t+29\u201348\u00a2\tDoubled to 38\u00a2 (Jul 2019) + CPI indexing + local taxes\nCalifornia\t~33\u00a2\t~54\u201373\u00a2\t+21\u201340\u00a2\t+12\u00a2 (Nov 2017) + annual inflation indexing\nIndiana\t~23\u00a2\t~51\u201355\u00a2\t+28\u201332\u00a2\t+10\u00a2 (2017) + inflation indexing + 7% use tax on gas\nOhio\t28\u00a2\t38.5\u00a2\t+10.5\u00a2\tSingle increase (2019)\nMichigan\t~24\u00a2\t~47\u201352\u00a2\t+23\u201328\u00a2\t+7.3\u00a2 (2017) + annual inflation adjustments (2022+)\nWashington\t44.5\u00a2\t~53\u201356.5\u00a2\t+9\u201312\u00a2\t2% annual compounding since 2016 increase\nOregon\t~30\u00a2\t~40\u201346\u00a2\t+10\u201316\u00a2\t10\u00a2 phased in 2018\u20132024\nMissouri\t17\u00a2\t29.5\u00a2\t+12.5\u00a2\tProposition D (2018), phased 2021\u20132025\nSouth Carolina\t17\u00a2\t~29\u00a2\t+12\u00a2\t12\u00a2 phased over 6 years (2017\u20132022)</p>\n<p>Notable 2026 Adjustments</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 2, "score_up": 13, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2113051275030085939", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVjhbn5E", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 42, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8898990, "raw_content": "", "author": "PiratePatriotParrot", "created": 1792632381996, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Votingnerd", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVjhbn5E.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/TheOnlyDSC/status/21